*-raw.json
ISMSF-R1
AIMSF-B1-REVISED.json
ANCHOR-SAMPLE.md
ISMSF-ROLLOUT-*.md
ISMSF-R1-probe*
ISMSF-R1-decued
ISMSF-R2*
ISMSF-ROLLOUT-*.md
PASSAGE-REPAIRS.json
ISMSF-R3*
ISMSF-R4*
*-TRANSLATION-R*.json
*-TRANSLATION-R*.json.partial.jsonl
ISMSF-R5*
# REVISE-118.json carries VERBATIM requote spans (key_support), unlike REVISE-116 whose edits
# were our own prose. The licensed text is the payload, so it cannot be de-licensed -- only untracked.
REVISE-118.json
# Every generation round and its raw/partial/report siblings. GENERIC on purpose: adding
# ISMSF-R3*, R4*, R5* one at a time is how ISMSF-R6 reached the index with 4,595 reproduced runs.
ISMSF-R[0-9]*
AIMSF-R[0-9]*
